y"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-modes.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"Executive · Social · Systems · Evidence · Personal. Density, ground and provenance vary; registers, rule, tick and states do not","name":"Five modes, one signature"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-threshold.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"The signature. Handle above, operating truth below, one rule, one ochre tick. It is rendered only when a truth register exists","name":"The threshold"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-wordmark.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Type only — no monogram. The threshold is the recognisable structure; the name is just set well","name":"Wordmark"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-graphite.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Dark is a transition, a closer, or personal mode — never the default and never a credibility shortcut","name":"Graphite ground"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-paper-ink.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"The ground and the voice — warm, unbleached, never pure white or pure black","name":"Paper & ink"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-roles.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"Components read only these. Ground · Surface · Ink · Signal · Warmth · Evidence · Constraint","name":"Semantic roles"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-signal.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"The only hue. It marks exactly one thing per artifact: the threshold tick, and by extension the decision","name":"Signal — one ochre"},{"path":"components/brand/brand.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"full · name · lockup — type only, no monogram","name":"Wordmark"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"primary · secondary · ghost · signal · sizes · disabled","name":"Button"},{"path":"components/data/data.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"decision matrix · con